		{
			dependencies: ["6F6F24013C03D5BF"]
			description: ["&fThe Scroll Forge is a key workstation for any serious mage, as it is the only reliable way to craft new spell scrolls. It consumes different types of Ink, using their rarity to decide how rare the resulting spells will be. You cannot use Ink that is lower rarity than the minimum rarity of the scroll you want to craft. Build the Scroll Forge, feed it the right Ink, and start churning out powerful spells for your Spell Books."]
			id: "156476208988AAA9"
